# Bridge spec for liboah_mojave.  One line per PowerPC function to mark.
#   LIB NAME SIG     table-driven bridge (gets the next gen ID, starting at 16)
#   LIB NAME =ID     hand-written bridge with a fixed ID (2..15)
# Order matters: gen IDs are assigned in file order, so only append new lines.
# SIG = RET:ARGS.  RET: i int/pointer, v void, b Boolean, h short, D double,
#                  T trace stub (log the call, return 0; no native function).
# ARGS: i word, f float, d double, C CGRect by value, G CGPoint by value,
#       R Rect* in, r Rect* out, X Rect* in/out, p Point* in/out,
#       K RGBColor* in, o UInt32* out, O UInt32* in/out, N 2xUInt32* in/out,
#       L EventTypeSpec* (count = previous argument), H handle given out by H.
# RET H: handle the guest dereferences itself (shadow master pointer).

